## Network Jobs

Local skill suite for warm-intro job search. Data lives in `~/.network-jobs/` (see SCHEMA.md in the suite).

### Routing

| User intent | Skill |
|-------------|-------|
| First install / fill profile / LinkedIn export help | `network-jobs-setup` |
| Import a LinkedIn connections ZIP | `network-jobs-import` |
| Find career pages + stage open roles for companies in my network | `careers-discover` |
| Promote triage batches into the searchable corpus | `jobs-ingest` |
| Search openings / "jobs at companies I'm connected to" | `network-jobs` |
| Draft a forwardable warm intro email | `intro-email-generator` |

### Rules

- Never curl `jobs.hirefrank.com` — all reads are local files under `~/.network-jobs/`.
- Never invent job fields (salary, dates) that were not captured.
- `careers-discover` stages only; wait for user confirm before `jobs-ingest`.
- Prefer `agent-browser` for JS-heavy career sites; fall back to curl/WebFetch for static/API pages.
